1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,327
An Interesting Festival.
有趣的节日。

2
00:00:04,327 --> 00:00:35,753
The Agricultural Feast takes place after Independence Day. It is not a worldwide celebration. Only Christians in Mexico look forward to its arrival for its religious origin.
农业盛宴在独立日之后举行。它不是一个全世界都庆祝的节日。由于其宗教渊源，只有墨西哥的基督徒期待它的到来。

3
00:00:35,753 --> 00:01:03,547
Long ago, humans’ ancestors were bad. They fooled and played tricks on each other and never kept their word. So God turned up and drowned all their crops.
很久以前，人类的祖先品行不好。他们互相欺骗、捉弄，从不信守诺言。于是上帝出现了，用水淹没了他们所有的庄稼。

4
00:01:03,547 --> 00:01:31,973
Humans starved day and night, weeping. In order to gain God’s forgiveness, a woman poet set off to see God. She admired God and kept apologizing.
人们日夜挨饿，哭泣不止。为了得到上帝的宽恕，一位女诗人动身去见上帝。她敬仰上帝，不断道歉。

5
00:01:31,973 --> 00:02:04,500
God was moved. With his permission, humans finally had good harvests again. So, to wipe away sadness and remind themselves of the belief in God, people began the festival.
上帝被感动了。在他的许可之下，人们终于再次获得了丰收。于是，为了消除悲伤，并提醒自己对上帝的信仰，人们开始庆祝这个节日。

6
00:02:04,500 --> 00:03:02,493
During the festival, people gather in the open air, such as playgrounds or parking lots, and energetically have fun with each other all night long, as though they were never tired. When a beauty dressed up in lovely clothing reads poems in memory of the poet, everyone holds their breath. Then, it is the custom that the bone of a rooster’s head is given to her as an award.
节日期间，人们聚集在露天场所，比如操场或停车场，大家兴高采烈地玩上一整夜，仿佛永远不会疲倦。当一位身穿漂亮衣服的女子，朗诵诗歌来纪念那位女诗人时，大家都会屏住呼吸。接着，按照习俗，会把一块公鸡头部的骨头，作为奖品送给这位女子。

7
00:03:02,493 --> 00:03:13,553
Obviously, the story is not true, but the festival is interesting.
显然，这个故事并不真实，但这个节日很有趣。
